element elementor-element-8ff47f6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ff47f6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJoin Arqaam if you are a professional seeking growth and new opportunities and enjoy working as part of a team to build the best investment bank in the region.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1706ca4\" data-id=\"1706ca4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1e44a6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f1e44a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam has built a successful team comprising of investment bankers and other professionals with in-depth experience from regional and international institutions, as well as market knowledge and practice. Arqaam understands that its future success relies on continuing to build and attract the best human capital in the region.<br><br>Our workforce is made up of 190 individuals in 5 offices from over 25 countries and a wealth of disciplines, meaning you will be working side by side with the best in the business to not only carve out your career path, but to use your unique perspective to make an impact.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4273e0c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4273e0c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2651fa2\" data-id=\"2651fa2\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef3f6e7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ef3f6e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam is constantly looking for new well-educated, professional and experienced team members with diverse backgrounds. Arqaam is committed to:<\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A merit based culture that recognises and rewards contribution, achievement, determination and performance<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An equal and fair opportunity to recruitment, remuneration, development and promotion<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A great and professional environment with mentoring and professional growth and development<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arqaam\u2019s remuneration structure is benchmarked according to regional and international standards and includes base salary, cash bonuses and other benefits.\u00a0 But Arqaam is unique in the share incentive scheme it offers to attract and retain the best talent and align employees with shareholders. In actual fact, Arqaam\u2019